<title>MALAYSIA: Johore Tenggara 1996 net up 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Johore Tenggara 1996 net up 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  23.48	vs	   19.89</p>
<p>    Shr	   (cents)     14.68	vs	   12.43</p>
<p>    Turnover		   136.46	vs	   76.48</p>
<p>    Minorities		   0.22	vs	    0.15</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    24.16	vs	   23.74</p>
<p>    Dividend    (cents)	5.5	 vs	    --</p>
<p>NOTE - The company's full name is Johore Tenggara Oil Palm Bhd. It is engaged in investment holding, cultivation of oil palm and manufacturing palm oil and related products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
